    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25616" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lāda</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lēda</span></b> , ae, f., and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lēdon</span></b> , i,
